(7080954, 1077831, 96751, '<td valign="top">OMG, you are too clever. Fabulous concept, a couple of hiccups in the execution. The line of green slime running down the front of the can (covering the "i") is just too straight, making it look fake. I wish the crop ether excluded the last blob, or included more of it. But, awesome</td>', 'OMG, you are too clever. Fabulous concept, a couple of hiccups in the execution. The line of green slime running down the front of the can (covering the "i") is just too straight, making it look fake. I wish the crop ether excluded the last blob, or included more of it. But, awesome', '2013-08-02 19:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
