(7084374, 1077605, 94815, '<td valign="top">Love this shot. It is so like sailing off the east coast of the US all night before the sun edges up over the horizon to begin the world all over again. There is no escaping that feeling. bump<br/> <br/>Edited to change from "until" to "before" the sun edges up, the point being this glow can only be witnessed when it is below the horizon and there are no distracting lights.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2013-08-09 11:13:30.</i></td>', 'Love this shot. It is so like sailing off the east coast of the US all night before the sun edges up over the horizon to begin the world all over again. There is no escaping that feeling. bump Edited to change from "until" to "before" the sun edges up, the point being this glow can only be witnessed when it is below the horizon and there are no distracting lights.', '2013-08-08 23:21:55.000000', '2013-08-09 12:13:30.000000', 1),
(7084377, 1077815, 100831, '<td valign="top">the way I would expect it to be.. beautifully rich image</td>', 'the way I would expect it to be.. beautifully rich image', '2013-08-08 23:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
