(7084381, 1077731, 94815, '<td valign="top">Lovely scene as we might think of primeval perfection and the idea of processing with painterly effects does add a sense of something more than than just "natural". But the effect seems a bit overdone to my taste since it makes it a more contemporary scene instead of that Biblical reference. voted earlier</td>', 'Lovely scene as we might think of primeval perfection and the idea of processing with painterly effects does add a sense of something more than than just "natural". But the effect seems a bit overdone to my taste since it makes it a more contemporary scene instead of that Biblical reference. voted earlier', '2013-08-08 23:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
