(7084462, 1077172, 136989, '<td valign="top">Great abstract.  Love the contrast between the white foam and the green.</td>', 'Great abstract.  Love the contrast between the white foam and the green.', '2013-08-09 00:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7084463, 1077057, 136989, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Wonderful depth in the colors and textures.  Creative idea.  My favorite in this challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful.  Wonderful depth in the colors and textures.  Creative idea.  My favorite in this challenge.', '2013-08-09 00:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7084464, 1077770, 136989, '<td valign="top">Totally disgusting soup.  Love it, even if the details do icky things to my stomach.  Great idea.</td>', 'Totally disgusting soup.  Love it, even if the details do icky things to my stomach.  Great idea.', '2013-08-09 00:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7084469, 1077831, 103142, '<td valign="top">oh, btw, the line of green might look too straight, but that''s what happens when you take soup and you plop it over the edge of the can. I didn''t trust myself with expert editing very much, so I just kind of glopped away. It really does fall in a straight line. :)<br/> <br/>However, the blobs on the counter needed some liquify. I really wanted to turn them into interesting creatures. I found out that I''m definitely NOT a graphic artist. :)<br/> <br/>Thanks for all the great comments! :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2013-08-09 00:11:06.</i></td>', 'oh, btw, the line of green might look too straight, but that''s what happens when you take soup and you plop it over the edge of the can. I didn''t trust myself with expert editing very much, so I just kind of glopped away. It really does fall in a straight line. :) However, the blobs on the counter needed some liquify. I really wanted to turn them into interesting creatures. I found out that I''m definitely NOT a graphic artist. :) Thanks for all the great comments! :)', '2013-08-09 01:09:19.000000', '2013-08-09 01:11:06.000000', 0),
(7084470, 1077831, 114285, '<td valign="top">And I thought mine was a shoehorn, lol!</td>', 'And I thought mine was a shoehorn, lol!', '2013-08-09 01:16:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(7084472, 1077818, 129807, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the yellow Mark. Excellent work. Sublime.</td>', 'Congrats on the yellow Mark. Excellent work. Sublime.', '2013-08-09 01:19:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(7084473, 1077057, 28742, '<td valign="top">Dayum, Judi - you never cease to amaze! Congrats!</td>', 'Dayum, Judi - you never cease to amaze! Congrats!', '2013-08-09 01:19:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(7084474, 1077818, 12611, '<td valign="top">Quite a stunning shot. Congrats on the ribbon.</td>', 'Quite a stunning shot. Congrats on the ribbon.', '2013-08-09 01:26:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(7084475, 1077770, 28742, '<td valign="top">I think I''ve said this before, but I would LOVE to see a video of you doing all your pre-production, production and post-production activities. If I ever get over to France, I will pay you a surprise visit as soon as an expert challenge is announced. ;-)<br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.kpriest.com/dpchallenge/gyaban_congrats3.png'', strrpos(''//www.kpriest.com/dpchallenge/gyaban_congrats3.png'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.kpriest.com/dpchallenge/gyaban_congrats3.png"/></td>', 'I think I''ve said this before, but I would LOVE to see a video of you doing all your pre-production, production and post-production activities. If I ever get over to France, I will pay you a surprise visit as soon as an expert challenge is announced. ;-)', '2013-08-09 01:27:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(7084476, 1077799, 12611, '<td valign="top">Nicely put together.  Contains a great feeling of wonder.</td>', 'Nicely put together.  Contains a great feeling of wonder.', '2013-08-09 01:27:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(7084477, 1077818, 28742, '<td valign="top">Way to go, Mark! Very well executed.</td>', 'Way to go, Mark! Very well executed.', '2013-08-09 01:28:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(7084480, 1077770, 27133, '<td valign="top">I love this image.  I believe it is probably your most advanced creation yet.  Both in the technicals and the meaning behind the image.  Fan-bloody-tastic!!!!</td>', 'I love this image.  I believe it is probably your most advanced creation yet.  Both in the technicals and the meaning behind the image.  Fan-bloody-tastic!!!!', '2013-08-09 01:31:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(7084486, 1077057, 32108, '<td valign="top">great concept, well executed.</td>', 'great concept, well executed.', '2013-08-09 01:50:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(7084489, 1077057, 96751, '<td valign="top">I agree with Christophe: the colors are just splendid, and the concept is lovely. Congrats on the blue.</td>', 'I agree with Christophe: the colors are just splendid, and the concept is lovely. Congrats on the blue.', '2013-08-09 02:04:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(7084491, 1077818, 114285, '<td valign="top">Would of thought a different Colour ribbon would''ve been better, still not much we can do these days unless you do indeed stretch yourself, but who has the time for that, we have families to look after ~&gt;)</td>', 'Would of thought a different Colour ribbon would''ve been better, still not much we can do these days unless you do indeed stretch yourself, but who has the time for that, we have families to look after ~>)', '2013-08-09 02:11:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(7084492, 1077770, 96751, '<td valign="top">I think my concept of primordial soup is more like chicken noodle than oozy gooey :-)<br/> <br/>I can''t say I love this, because it makes me feel all sorts of uncomfortable, icky things. And it is rather gruesome and macabre, and a bit violent. Everything "creation" likely is. But man, I sure do appreciate your gift and your ability to express your vision.  Congrats on the ribbon.</td>', 'I think my concept of primordial soup is more like chicken noodle than oozy gooey :-) I can''t say I love this, because it makes me feel all sorts of uncomfortable, icky things. And it is rather gruesome and macabre, and a bit violent. Everything "creation" likely is. But man, I sure do appreciate your gift and your ability to express your vision.  Congrats on the ribbon.', '2013-08-09 02:12:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(7084493, 1077818, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice one, Mark. Simple yet very effective. Congrats on the ribbon</td>', 'Nice one, Mark. Simple yet very effective. Congrats on the ribbon', '2013-08-09 02:14:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(7084495, 1077767, 96751, '<td valign="top">Ah nuts. Thought this would be on the podium. But tt ain''t bad either ;-)</td>', 'Ah nuts. Thought this would be on the podium. But tt ain''t bad either ;-)', '2013-08-09 02:16:44.000000', NULL, 0),
