(7084818, 1077767, 103142, '<td valign="top">I think that''s the one you found when I was there -- unless you find ones that incredibly perfect everyday. :)<br/> <br/>I thought it looked familiar, at least. :)<br/> <br/>Beautifully done.</td>', 'I think that''s the one you found when I was there -- unless you find ones that incredibly perfect everyday. :) I thought it looked familiar, at least. :) Beautifully done.', '2013-08-09 18:51:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(7084824, 1077831, 114969, '<td valign="top">It is funny indeed that we chose the same approach to answer this challenge :) I had no idea that a real product was named like that! Did you buy a can specially for the challenge, or do you eat that soup on a regular basis? Given its color, I hope you don''t, haha ;-) Thanks for the laugh! It is very difficult to come up with an humorous entry, so hats off for daring going this route. And to celebrate your entry, I promise to look tomorrow at the supermarket for such soup!</td>', 'It is funny indeed that we chose the same approach to answer this challenge :) I had no idea that a real product was named like that! Did you buy a can specially for the challenge, or do you eat that soup on a regular basis? Given its color, I hope you don''t, haha ;-) Thanks for the laugh! It is very difficult to come up with an humorous entry, so hats off for daring going this route. And to celebrate your entry, I promise to look tomorrow at the supermarket for such soup!', '2013-08-09 19:31:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(7084825, 1077770, 114969, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Bear_Music:</b></div><hr/><i> Absolutely first rate execution of the vision. Amazing how much more satisfying it is when viewed at the Deviant Art link. Big congrats on the ribbon! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks a lot Robert, much appreciated. And yes, DPC would look much better with higher resolution entries!</td>', 'Originally posted by Bear_Music: Absolutely first rate execution of the vision. Amazing how much more satisfying it is when viewed at the Deviant Art link. Big congrats on the ribbon!   Thanks a lot Robert, much appreciated. And yes, DPC would look much better with higher resolution entries!', '2013-08-09 19:35:37.000000', NULL, 0),
